:: StoryTitle
The Thunder of Origins

:: StoryData
{
  "id": "tuono-delle-origini",
  "author": "Specula Elementae",
  "startPassage": "prologo"
}

:: prologo [opening]
Bolt cuts across the sky and thunder makes you jump. It is a beautiful power that must be used with care.

[[Strike->inizio-avventura]]

:: inizio-avventura
Lightning never arrives in exactly the same way: sometimes fast, sometimes slow. That is why you must look carefully before you move.

:: evento-round-2 [mid-story]
A storm arrives. Thunder gives you a lot of extra strength. But when you are very strong, you must also be more careful not to make mistakes.

```gameEffects
{
  "allCardsPowerBonus": 2,
  "hpPenaltyOnLoss": 1,
  "roundSpecific": 2
}
```

:: epilogo-vittoria [ending victory]
You learned to use thunder with care. The sky seems pleased with you.

:: epilogo-sconfitta [ending defeat]
Lightning returns to the clouds, but it is not over. Storms always come back, and you can try again.
